<title>HONG KONG: Kosonic interim net loss HK$27.87 mln.</title>
<headline>Kosonic interim net loss HK$27.87 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.8 loss   vs  2.1 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  9.38 loss  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    27.87 loss vs  9.84 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     181.82     vs  498.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kosonic International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Kosonic International is a maker of compact disc audio systems.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$4.82 million on provision for corporate restructuring costs including additional provision for closure of production facilities in the People's Republic of China during and after the interim period and loss of HK$4.57 million on closure of the research and development centre in Taiwan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
